WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.864
Today is the first screen every morning.

2
00:00:03.051 --> 00:00:06.754
It greets you and says in one sentence how many relationships

3
00:00:06.754 --> 00:00:10.167
need your attention and what is on today’s agenda.

4
00:00:11.267 --> 00:00:12.382
The “Attention field”

5
00:00:12.382 --> 00:00:16.200
ranks clients by urgency, with the reason and the next move.

6
00:00:16.445 --> 00:00:17.444
The “Daily briefing”

7
00:00:17.444 --> 00:00:20.287
is written by AVRASTRO from your own data.

8
00:00:21.387 --> 00:00:25.450
Next to it, today’s appointments and tasks and whatever is overdue,

9
00:00:25.694 --> 00:00:27.110
the cases in motion,

10
00:00:27.238 --> 00:00:30.895
the decisions you are waiting for from clients, and moments:

11
00:00:31.081 --> 00:00:33.983
birthdays and name days in the coming days.

12
00:00:35.083 --> 00:00:36.232
The “Constellation”

13
00:00:36.232 --> 00:00:37.973
shows your book as a living map:

14
00:00:38.160 --> 00:00:41.399
the closer to the centre, the sooner a client needs you,

15
00:00:41.399 --> 00:00:43.732
and the size shows the annual portfolio.

16
00:00:43.860 --> 00:00:46.889
Hover to see why, and click to open.

17
00:00:47.989 --> 00:00:49.208
With “Start Flow”

18
00:00:49.208 --> 00:00:51.726
you go through the day’s actions one by one.

19
00:00:51.855 --> 00:00:54.363
And if everything is in order, Today suggests

20
00:00:54.363 --> 00:00:57.706
calling someone you have not spoken to in a while.

21
00:00:58.806 --> 00:00:59.781
In the next lesson:

22
00:00:59.781 --> 00:01:03.414
appointment requests from avrastro.com and your agenda.
